<title>JAPAN: Eiwa plans share split.</title>
<headline>Eiwa plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eiwa Corp said on Friday it</p>
<p>planned a 1.2-for-1 share split on May 19, 1997 for</p>
<p>shareholders as of March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
